title: Media
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: media_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; media_timer += 6;
card-image: img/sangerbund.jpg

= Media

Through its media holding, the SPD still owns shares in regional newspapers across the country, and the party has its own channels online. What should we do with them?

- @commercial
- @campaign
- @ideological
- @radio
- @radio_2
- @radio_3
- @radio_4
- @return: We should not do anything with media at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@commercial
title: Run our media holdings commercially.
subtitle: This might upset purists, but it brings in money and reaches readers beyond our base.
on-arrival: resources += 1; commercialized_media += 1; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 10

Our newspapers make more money. The left and the AfA complain that we are selling out.

@campaign
title: Our media should help us win elections.
subtitle: Our channels will focus on the campaign.
on-arrival: campaign_media += 1; workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent);

Our campaign content mostly reaches people who already vote for us, but it must be doing *something*, or so we hope.

@ideological
title: Make room for open debate in the party.
subtitle: All factions get space to air their views.
on-arrival: left_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6

The debates are lively, and every faction feels heard.

@radio
title: Build our own social media channels.
subtitle: -2 resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio = 0
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 2; new_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); labor_dissent += 5; socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent) if pacifism > 1; trust_in_democracy += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization > 1

The AfD has dominated TikTok and YouTube for years. We hire young creators and start our own channels with short videos, podcasts and livestreams. At first we mostly reach the young urban middle class, as the AfA points out.

@radio_2
title: Keep building our online presence.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 0 and radio <= 3
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; trust_in_democracy += 3*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

Our channels mix entertainment with politics, and are growing fast.

@radio_3
title: Keep building our online presence.
subtitle: Our channels now pay for themselves.
view-if: radio > 3 and radio <= 5 and year <= 2031
on-arrival: radio += 1; new_middle_spd += 5*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 3*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 3*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; trust_in_democracy += 3*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

Our channels have become one of our best tools for reaching voters.

@radio_4
title: Keep supporting our online channels.
subtitle: Every party is online now, and it is harder to stand out. -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
view-if: radio > 3 and (radio >= 6 or year >= 2032) and radio <= 9
on-arrival: radio += 1; resources -= 1; new_middle_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); old_middle_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1 - dissent); rural_spd += 2*(1 - dissent); unemployed_spd += 2*(1-dissent); socialism += 2*(1 - dissent); nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent)*(pacifism-2) if pacifism > 2; trust_in_democracy += 2*(1-dissent)*(democratization-2) if democratization > 2

We keep investing in our channels, but the competition for attention is fierce.
